---
<section class="section bg-alt border-tb">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="anrt-layout">
            <div class="anrt-text">
                <div class="badge">Official Compliance</div>
                <h2 class="section-title">Officially Regulated by ANRT</h2>
                <p class="anrt-description">Our .ma domain registrations operate in strict compliance with the Agence Nationale de Réglementation des Télécommunications (ANRT). This ensures maximum security, transparent dispute resolution policies, and adherence to the official .ma naming charter.</p>
                
                <p class="anrt-description mt-2">When you register with us, you can have absolute trust that your domain ownership is legally sound and fully recognized by Moroccan authorities.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="anrt-visual">
                <div class="shield-icon">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>100% Secure & Compliant</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .bg-alt {
        background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
    }
    
    .border-tb {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .anrt-layout {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4rem;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .anrt-text {
        flex: 1;
        max-width: 600px;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: rgba(81, 112, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .anrt-description {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .mt-2 {
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .anrt-visual {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: white;
        padding: 4rem 3rem;
        border-radius: var(--border-radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        flex: 0 0 400px;
    }

    .shield-icon {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .anrt-visual h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .anrt-layout {
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .anrt-text {
            max-width: 100%;
        }
        .anrt-visual {
            width: 100%;
            flex: auto;
        }
    }
</style>
